べたり\n一緒にお昼寝したり\n一緒にじゃれあったり\n\nサトシとルガルガンが仲良くしている色んなシーンを見てみたいです！\n(サトシはサン&ムーンの時の服装でお願いします！)", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hibani123/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/455211a0/uploads/origins/fd7cb4b5-7789-4bc7-81ee-8caecac47029?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c1a78155aa32244b179b429e32524b1d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/455211a0/uploads/origins/fd7cb4b5-7789-4bc7-81ee-8caecac47029?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c1a78155aa32244b179b429e32524b1d, https://si.imgix.net/455211a0/uploads/origins/fd7cb4b5-7789-4bc7-81ee-8caecac47029?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6f7471653a2128c8fd6e4bf2a67a5852 2x, https://si.imgix.net/455211a0/uploads/origins/fd7cb4b5-7789-4bc7-81ee-8caecac47029?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c443591361921784f09d71de4f3d2eb4 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "サン&ムーンのサトシとサトシのルガルガンのコンビで、かっこいいイラストをお願いします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hibani123/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b774836e/uploads/origins/b929dff4-3c7d-4d83-9b16-2e5c49c52b7f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=acc823ee93d02b874fa610be88aec2be", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b774836e/uploads/origins/b929dff4-3c7d-4d83-9b16-2e5c49c52b7f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=acc823ee93d02b874fa610be88aec2be, https://si.imgix.net/b774836e/uploads/origins/b929dff4-3c7d-4d83-9b16-2e5c49c52b7f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=